### Colección para el cliente HTTP de IntelliJ / extensión "REST Client" de VS Code
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Registrarse
# @name register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@example.pe", "password": "Password123", "fullName": "Ana Torres"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. Buscar productos (público)
GET {{base}}/api/products?q=monitor&maxPrice=1500&sort=price,asc

### 3. Agregar al carrito
POST {{base}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 8, "quantity": 1}

### 4. Checkout
# @name checkout
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shippingAddress": {"fullName": "Ana Torres", "line1": "Av. Arequipa 1234", "district": "Miraflores", "city": "Lima", "phone": "987654321"}}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### 5. Pagar (idempotente)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-0d4b-4c41-9a63-1f0d7c3e2b10
Content-Type: application/json

{"cardToken": "tok_visa"}

### 6. Login de administrador
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@shopflow.dev", "password": "Admin12345"}

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 7. Marcar como enviado
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "SHIPPED", "note": "Courier: Olva"}

### 8. Reporte de ventas
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reports/sales?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
